# Frequently asked questions

## Access and invitations

### Why do I need an invitation code?

The simulator is currently invite-only. This helps the maintainers manage access while the platform and multiplayer capabilities continue to develop.

### Why is my code not working?

Codes contain exactly six letters or digits and must be entered exactly as issued. A code cannot be used again after registration and may be revoked or expired. Contact the administrator or Team Vietnam if you need a new one.

### Can I request access?

Yes. Use **Request Invite** on the [home page](/) and provide your contact details.

## Account and session

### Why was I sent to sign in?

The dashboard and robot builder require an active account. The app remembers the page you requested and returns you after successful sign-in when possible.

### How do I sign out?

Use **Sign out** in the header on any protected simulator page. This ends the browser session and returns you to the public home page.

### My robot did not save. What should I do?

Confirm that you are signed in and have a stable connection, then try saving again. If the error continues, include the visible error message when you contact support.

## Need help?

For access, account, or project questions, email [vietnamteamfgc@gmail.com](mailto:vietnamteamfgc@gmail.com). You can also follow [Team Vietnam on Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/TeamVietnamFGC) and [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/teamvietnam.fgc/).

